// ── Utility fn signatures ────────────────────────────────────────────
//
// These fns are not defined here as DSL fn items because the lowerer
// creates standalone nodes for all fn items in a module, causing
// "missing input" errors when the module is imported transitively.
//
// Signatures (for documentation):
//   comment_line(text: String, syntax: CommentSyntax) -> String
//   map_abstract_type(abstract_type: String, mapping: TypeMapping) -> String
